  "description": "<p>This task is a follow-on to: <br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2402\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2402</a></p>\n\n<p>The work of this task should include:<br/>\nUpdate: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Best+Practices+-+Fedora+Configuration\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Best+Practices+-+Fedora+Configuration</a><br/>\nUpdate: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+JDBC+Object+Store\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+JDBC+Object+Store</a><br/>\nCreate: new AWS/S3 page<br/>\nCreate: Readme in 'fcrepo-configs/src/main/resources/config' that references the appropriate wiki pages.</p>\n\n<p>In terms of content, the recommendations are:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Externalize configuration files, and include passwords directly therein</li>\n\t<li>Only use system properties for passwords if you are fully comfortable with the risk of exposing that information to others who have access to the system.</li>\n</ul>\n",
